{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BEKZv42Ygho1B2zeW1CoQQ","type":"tool_result","content":"To find the total number of farmers markets for U.S. states (excluding territories like Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands), I need to sum the `farmers_markets` column for all entries except PR and VI.\n\nAdding all state values from California through Hawaii:\n\n647 + 555 + 426 + 390 + 370 + 336 + 335 + 321 + 273 + 246 + 231 + 219 + 216 + 208 + 196 + 194 + 183 + 181 + 164 + 159 + 140 + 124 + 123 + 122 + 115 + 102 + 97 + 95 + 86 + 84 + 78 + 77 + 73 + 71 + 59 + 59 + 57 + 57 + 55 + 54 + 50 + 49 + 49 + 34 + 33 + 43 + 30 + 28 + 18 + 17 + 13 = **8,687**"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f89b3b75-4d6f-4cea-9c25-8056cb2826bc","uuid":"a847e52e-d35d-409b-9713-bb2e54b41d08","timestamp":"2026-08-16T20:07:31.780Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2651,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"To find the total number of farmers markets for U.S. states (excluding territories like Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands), I need to sum the `farmers_markets` column for all entries except PR and VI.\n\nAdding all state values from California through Hawaii:\n\n647 + 555 + 426 + 390 + 370 + 336 + 335 + 321 + 273 + 246 + 231 + 219 + 216 + 208 + 196 + 194 + 183 + 181 + 164 + 159 + 140 + 124 + 123 + 122 + 115 + 102 + 97 + 95 + 86 + 84 + 78 + 77 + 73 + 71 + 59 + 59 + 57 + 57 + 55 + 54 + 50 + 49 + 49 + 34 + 33 + 43 + 30 + 28 + 18 + 17 + 13 = **8,687**","durationMs":2766,"url":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv"}}
